OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested for indecent exposure
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,6,Findecent exposure in East Sussex,
OL,7,Fpolice say.
OL,9,FSussex Police said the man, a
OL,10,F20-year-old Iranian national living in
OL,11,FCrowborough, was arrested after a
OL,12,Freport of a man "behaving indecently"
OL,13,Fin The Warren at about 19:10 GMT on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FHe has been released on bail while
OL,17,Fenquiries continue.
OL,19,FAnyone with information is asked to
OL,20,Fcontact the force.
